GRID-LIB : get "grid" from "remixdPrograms/Mazes"

using GRID-LIB
	'grid' : a grid of 4 by 4
	
	'binary tree' : binary tree maze based on 'grid'
	
	binary tree maze based on 'grid' :
		on each 'cell' in 'grid'
			'neighbours' : { }
			
			from 'cell' in 'grid' if NORTH add to 'neighbours'
			from 'cell' in 'grid' if EAST add to 'neighbours'

			'link' : choose from 'neighbours'
			if ('link' ≠ null)
				link 'cell' to 'link'
				"cell:", 'cell', " neighbours:", 'neighbours', " link:", 'link' ↲

	=-
	If there is a path from the 'cell' in the 'grid' in the specified 'direction'
	then add the connected cell to the 'neighbours' list.
	=-
	from 'cell' in 'grid' if 'direction' add to 'neighbours' :
		'connected cell' : 'direction' of 'cell' in 'grid'
		if ('connected cell' ≠ null)
			append 'connected cell' to 'neighbours'

'cell' : 'grid' cell at { 2, 3 }
'cell' links
